  "story": {
    "day": 31,
    "title": "A Special Cooking Class",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya always enjoyed cooking with her favorite English teacher.",
      "Today, a chef from New York visited their school kitchen.",
      "\"Pardon, where is the salmon from?\" Kaya asked him.",
      "He showed a picture and said it came from Finland.",
      "Next, they made a good soup with soft purple potatoes.",
      "Then, they shared a lovely sweet and sour apple cake.",
      "It was hard work, but the chef did a great job.",
      "Suddenly, his telephone rang near the window.",
      "He spoke about China, and Kaya said \"Thank you\" finally."
    ]
  }
